{"speciesId":349,"names":{"fr":"Barpau","es":"Feebas","en":"Feebas","ja":"ヒンバス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FEEBAS’s fins are ragged and tattered from the start of its life. Because of its shoddy appearance, this POKéMON is largely ignored. It is capable of living in both the sea and in rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"While FEEBAS’s body is in tatters, it has a hardy and tenacious life force that enables it to live anywhere. However, this POKéMON is also slow and dimwitted, making it an easy catch."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"FEEBAS live in ponds that are heavily infested with weeds. Because of its hopelessly shabby appearance, it seems as if few TRAINERS raise it."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Ridiculed for its shabby appearance, it is ignored by researchers. It lives in ponds choked with weeds."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Ridiculed for its shabby appearance, it is ignored by researchers. It lives in ponds choked with weeds."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is famous for its shabby appearance. While populous, they tend to cluster in set locations."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It eats anything, so it can even live in polluted streams and lakes. No one pays any attention to it."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon a peut-être un physique disgracieux, mais il est robuste et peut survivre dans très peu d’eau."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon a peut-être un physique disgracieux, mais il est robuste et peut survivre dans très peu d’eau."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut vivre dans les fleuves et les lacs pollués car il mange de tout. Personne ne se soucie de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Come de todo, por lo que puede vivir en aguas contaminadas. Nadie le presta atención."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It eats anything, so it can even live in polluted streams and lakes. No one pays any attention to it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"なんでも 食べるので 汚い 川や 湖でも 生きていける。 だれも 注目しない ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son apparence est pathétique. Il forme des bancs dans les rivières riches en plantes aquatiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es el Pokémon con peor aspecto. Vive en grupos en lechos de ríos con abundantes plantas acuáticas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"一番 みすぼらしい ポケモン。 水草の 多い 川底で 大勢 集まって 暮らしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les nageoires de Barpau sont abîmées et déchirées dès sa naissance. Ce Pokémon est généralement ignoré à cause de son apparence miséreuse. Il peut vivre dans la mer ou en eau douce."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feebas tiene las aletas melladas y rasgadas desde que nace. Debido a este aspecto poco imponente, son pocos los que lo tienen en cuenta. Este Pokémon puede vivir tanto en agua salada como dulce."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feebas’s fins are ragged and tattered from the start of its life. Because of its shoddy appearance, this Pokémon is largely ignored. It is capable of living in both the sea and in rivers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"生まれつき ヒレが ボロボロで みっともないため 誰にも 相手に されない ポケモンだ。 海と 川の どちらでも 生活できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Même si le corps de Barpau est en lambeaux, il reste tenace et obstiné, ce qui lui permet de survivre partout. Cependant, ce Pokémon est très lent et un peu bête, ce qui en fait une proie facile."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aunque Feebas tenga el cuerpo mellado, posee una tremenda y constante fuerza vital que le permite vivir en cualquier lugar. Con todo, es un Pokémon lento y simplón; es fácil de atrapar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"While Feebas’s body is in tatters, it has a hardy and tenacious life force that enables it to live anywhere. However, this Pokémon is also slow and dimwitted, making it an easy catch."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体は ボロボロだが どこでも 生きていける しぶとい 生命力を 持つ ポケモン。 しかし ノロマなので すぐに 捕まってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon n’a pas beaucoup d’adeptes, du fait de son air miteux. Il est pourtant robuste et n’a pas peur de nager en eaux troubles."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Este Pokémon es tan resistente que puede vivir sin problema hasta en las aguas más sucias, pero no es muy popular a causa de su aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A tough Pokémon that is perfectly fine even in dirty water. However, due to its ragged, shabby appearance, it isn’t popular."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"汚い 水でも ぜんぜん 平気な タフな ポケモン。 でも ボロボロで みすぼらしいので 人気は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme il est tout de même franchement laid, ce Pokémon a un succès très mitigé. Sa grande vitalité fait néanmoins l’objet de moult études."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Como su aspecto deja bastante que desear, no se le aprecia mucho. Aun así, su gran vitalidad puede ser muy interesante para la ciencia."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Although unattractive and unpopular, this Pokémon’s marvelous vitality has made it a subject of research."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"見た目が 悪いので 人気はないが 脅威の 生命力が あり 研究対象には なっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son apparence peu ragoûtante repousse les prédateurs et dissuade les gens de le pêcher. Sa population augmente donc rapidement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Debido a su cuerpo mellado y su feo aspecto, no es muy apetecible como presa ni popular entre los Entrenadores y por eso está proliferando."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They look ragged, so no one catches them. They look like they’d taste bad, so predators won’t eat them. And their numbers continue to grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ボロボロなので 誰も 捕まえない。 まずそうなので 獲物にも されない。 結果的に どんどん 増えていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"En raison de sa laideur, la plupart des gens détournent le regard quand ils le croisent. Il a cependant des fans qui le collectionnent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Debido a su aspecto tan descuidado, la mayoría de la gente no le presta atención. Sin embargo, hay personas que coleccionan solo Feebas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Because of its wretched appearance, most people pay it no attention, but there are some who collect Feebas—and Feebas alone!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"みすぼらしいので 大抵の 人は 見向きも しないが ヒンバス だけを 集める コレクターだって いるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Comme il est tout de même franchement laid, ce Pokémon a un succès très mitigé. Sa grande vitalité fait néanmoins l’objet de moult études."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su aspecto poco agraciado hace que no sea muy popular, pero su gran vitalidad resulta de gran interés para la ciencia."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Although unattractive and unpopular, this Pokémon’s marvelous vitality has made it a subject of research."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"見た目が 悪いので 人気はないが 脅威の 生命力が あり 研究対象には なっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon a peut-être un physique disgracieux, mais il est robuste et peut survivre dans très peu d’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su apariencia deja bastante que desear, pero es muy resistente y puede sobrevivir con poca agua."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"みすぼらしく 醜い ポケモンだが しぶとい 生命力を もち わずかな 水だけでも 生き延びる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":349,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",15],[9,"level-up",15],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine